# Unova's Champion (Iris, the girl from the Village of Dragons): a fierce, soaring trumpet line in G minor over brass that rears
# like a dragon, a running piano, octave bass and a hammering kit, the brass giving way to an alarm while a Pokémon of the
# player's is in the red. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U9, part c).
title Battle! Champion (Unova)
tempo 176
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.2

